  "title": "Shared TypeTerm, semantic binders and expression structure — design contract",
  "$comment": "Exact shared structures from docs/作者/组合/结构编辑与身份保持.md and 参数包与类型级值.md. This is not a production reader. Type/kind, lexical resolution, arity, hygiene, uniqueness, unit/Int codecs, context restrictions, effects, capture, pure phase qualification, closed constructor qualification and resource bounds require the named semantic owners.",
